<canvas id="canvas_0" width="600" height="220" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="XI.27 diagram" src="propXI27.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    // Joyce's figure: the given solid CD (faces GF, GE and the top filled,
    // FO, DO, EO the far edges) and the solid AL on AB (faces KH, KB and
    // the top filled, HM, LM, BM the far edges).
    //
    // The walk builds AL: AB, AH, AK are solid slide twins, hidden at rest
